  "name": "Alaska Seaweed Database: A Flora of the Benthic Marine Algae of Alaska, Phase I, an Inventory of Existing Collections (Type Specimen Data)",
  "description": "First comprehensive cataloguing of the marine benthic algae (seaweeds) occurring along Alaska coast. (By Sandra Lindstrom, UBC and Gayle Hansen, OSU)\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To provide information on the type specimens of species of seaweeds reported to occur in Alaska.",
